<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>泳池 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%B3%B3%E6%B1%A0/</link><description>Recent content in 泳池 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%B3%B3%E6%B1%A0/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>游泳：公共泳池的泳道规矩、合游与救生员提醒</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/swimming/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/swimming/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;从进门买票到游完冲澡&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序，拆成五个细化场景：到前台买 day pass 顺便问泳道和泳帽规定、跟陌生人合用一条泳道、游到一半被救生员吹哨、靠在池边聊泳姿和数圈、游完冲澡办次卡再约下次。主角是你——第一次去美国公共泳池的人，配角是常客 Jess、泳池前台和当班救生员。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>